s、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":19,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:17.702Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"5078f8e2-68fc-42af-8ff6-8412c0f735e6","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt_id":"5078f8e2-68fc-42af-8ff6-8412c0f735e6","session_id":"3baabcd5-1959-4c90-be14-04cfdab9210c","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"85c21e49-a1c2-40ce-af16-683debf94212","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"ae9eafc2-553f-41ef-8f15-4baf7765050e","thread":"85c21e49-a1c2-40ce-af16-683debf94212","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-ae9eafc2-553f-41ef-8f15-4baf7765050e"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-uq4d0ktg/state/worktrees/5078f8e2-68fc-42af-8ff6-8412c0f735e6","base_commit":"1359ead04a9908a82499f388cbc6cec4be5528a8","card_snapshot_id":"a9d8c381-1292-4a98-b60d-98a55319d65d","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261011-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":20,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:18.902Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"5078f8e2-68fc-42af-8ff6-8412c0f735e6","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-uq4d0ktg/repo","cat-file","-t","57209de889e63376f5cf0cc160335fb11949bd70"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-uq4d0ktg/repo"}},{"seq":21,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:18.909Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"5078f8e2-68fc-42af-8ff6-8412c0f735e6","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-uq4d0ktg/repo","cat-file","-t","57209de889e63376f5cf0cc160335fb11949bd70"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-uq4d0ktg/repo","stdout":"commit\n","stderr":"","exit":0,"returncode":0}},{"seq":22,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:18.909Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"5078f8e2-68fc-42af-8ff6-8412c0f735e6","type":